asoning if you deny it.\\n\\n---BEGIN USER CLARIFICATION HISTORY---\\nQuestion: Hello! I’m Delta, your Chief of Staff. I’m here to help plan, organize, and execute any software or technical project you have in mind—end-to-end. What would you like me to create or assist you with today?\\nResponse: Please create a neighborhood association (HOA) website for my community of about 50 households and 200 residents. The website should be user-friendly and allow residents to log in to view restricted data such as meeting minutes, financial reports, and other sensitive information. The website should also have a section for news and updates, as well as a contact form for residents to reach out with questions or concerns.  Here is the list of pages I would like to have on the website:  Contact Us, Bylaws, Schools, Dues (protected), Annual Meetings (protected), and News & Events (protected)  Please use Next.js and Vercel for lightweight hosting, and ensure that the website is easy to navigate and update. The blog/updates section should be easy to update by any board member without needing to know any coding or be proficient in tech. To this end there should be a simple admin dashboard or editor.  For cloud services and authentication, please use Firebase for maximum ease of use and security. The website should be designed to be responsive and accessible on both desktop and mobile devices.  Please keep things simple and straightforward, as I am not very tech-savvy. The website should be visually appealing but not overly complex. The main goal is to have a functional and easy-to-use website that serves the needs of our community.  Thank you very much!\\n\\n---END USER CLARIFICATION HISTORY---\\n\\n---BEGIN DEP---\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nHOA WEBSITE – MASTER DETERMINISTICALLY EXECUTABLE PLAN  (v3 – FINAL)\\n────────────────────────────────────────\\nRepo root = “/”.  Next.js 14 App-Router, TypeScript, TailwindCSS, Firebase (Auth, Firestore, Storage, Functions), Vercel hosting.\\n\\n0. PREREQUISITES\\n   • Node 18+   • npm 9+   • GitHub repo   • Vercel & Firebase CLI\\n   • Firebase projects reserved: hoa-portal-dev / hoa-portal-prod\\n\\n1. INITIAL PROJECT BOOTSTRAP (run once)\\n   npx create-next-app@latest hoa-portal --typescript --tailwind --eslint --app --no-src-dir --import-alias \\\"@/*\\\"\\n   cd hoa-portal && git init && git remote add origin <repo-url>\\n   npm i firebase @firebase/auth @firebase/firestore @firebase/storage\\n   npm i @tiptap/react @tiptap/starter-kit @tiptap/extension-markdown marked react-use clsx\\n   npm i -D jest @testing-library/react @testing-library/jest-dom playwrightexpect axe-playwright husky lint-staged\\n   npx husky install && echo \\\"#!/bin/sh\\\\nnpm run lint && npm run test\\\" > .husky/pre-commit\\n\\n2. APP ROUTER STRUCTURE (every route/page listed)\\napp/\\n  layout.tsx                        – root providers (AuthProvider, ThemeProvider)\\n  globals.css\\n  not-found.tsx                     – custom 404\\n\\n  (public)/layout.tsx               – header/footer\\n  (public)/page.tsx                 – Home /\\n  (public)/contact/page.tsx         – Contact Us (form)\\n  (public)/bylaws/page.tsx          – Bylaws\\n  (public)/schools/page.tsx         – Schools\\n  (public)/login/page.tsx           – Login\\n\\n  (member)/layout.tsx               – extends header, adds member nav\\n  (member)/dues/page.tsx            – Dues (protected)\\n  (member)/meetings/page.tsx        – Annual Meetings list\\n  (member)/meetings/[year]/page.tsx – Meeting detail\\n  (member)/news-events/page.tsx     – News & Events list\\n  (member)/news-events/[slug]/page.tsx – News article\\n  (member)/financial-reports/page.tsx   – Financial Reports list (PDF downloads)\\n\\n  (admin)/layout.tsx                – sidebar\\n  (admin)/dashboard/page.tsx        – Dashboard index\\n  (admin)/news/*                    – CRUD: list, new, [id]\\n  (admin)/minutes/*                 – upload & list minutes\\n  (admin)/financial-reports/*       – upload & list reports\\n  (admin)/bylaws/page.tsx           – rich-text editor\\n  (admin)/schools/page.tsx          – rich-text editor\\n  (admin)/contact-messages/page.tsx – inbox list & delete\\n\\n  api/contact/route.ts              – POST handler (contact form)\\n\\nmiddleware.ts                       – edge auth/role gate\\n\\n3. COMPONENTS / LIBS (one file each, OFAAT-ready)\\ncomponents/layout/{Header.tsx,Footer.tsx,MobileMenu.tsx}\\ncomponents/ui/{Button.tsx,Card.tsx,Modal.tsx,Spinner.tsx,Alert.tsx,FileCard.tsx}\\ncomponents/editor/RichTextEditor.tsx\\nforms/{LoginForm.tsx,ContactForm.tsx}\\ncontext/{AuthContext.tsx,ThemeContext.tsx}\\nhooks/{useAuth.ts,useBreakpoint.ts,useFirestoreCollection.ts}\\nlib/{firebaseClient.ts,firebaseAdmin.ts,firestore.ts,auth.ts,api.ts,sendgrid.ts}\\n\\n4. AUTHENTICATION & SECURITY\\n4.1  Cloud Functions\\n   functions/auth/onCreate.ts        – set default role \\\"resident\\\"\\n   functions/https/setRole.ts        – callable; admin sets role {resident|boardMember|admin}\\n   functions/https/sendContactEmail.ts (optional) – emails board when SENDGRID_API_KEY present\\n4.2  Edge middleware.ts – verifies cookie JWT; route matcher\\n4.3  Firestore Data Collections\\n   dues-docs, meeting-minutes, news, bylaws, schools (siteContent), financial_reports, contact_messages, users\\n4.4  firestore.rules  (FULL snippet)\\n```\\nrules_version = '2';\\nservice cloud.firestore {\\n  match /databases/{db}/documents {\\n    function isResident()    { return request.auth != null; }\\n    function isBoardMember() { return request.auth.token.role in ['boardMember','admin']; }\\n    function isAdmin()       { return request.auth.token.role == 'admin'; }\\n    function isPublicWrite() { return request.time > timestamp.date(2023,1,1) &&\\n                               request.time.diff(resource.data.submittedAt, 'm') > 1; }\\n\\n    // PUBLIC read\\n    match /bylaws/{doc}        { allow read: if true;  allow write: if isBoardMember(); }\\n    match /schools/{doc}       { allow read: if true;  allow write: if isBoardMember(); }\\n\\n    // MEMBER read / BOARD write\\n    match /dues-docs/{doc}     { allow read: if isResident(); allow write: if isBoardMember(); }\\n    match /meeting-minutes/{doc}{ allow read: if isResident(); allow write: if isBoardMember(); }\\n    match /news/{doc}          { allow read: if isResident(); allow write: if isBoardMember(); }\\n    match /financial_reports/{doc}{ allow read: if isResident(); allow write: if isBoardMember(); }\\n\\n    // Contact messages – public create, board/admin read\\n    match /contact_messages/{doc}{\\n      allow create: if isPublicWrite();\\n      allow read,delete: if isBoardMember();\\n      allow update: if false;\\n    }\\n\\n    // Users self management\\n    match /users/{uid}         { allow read,write: if request.auth.uid == uid; }\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n4.5  storage.rules (excerpt)\\n```\\nservice firebase.storage {\\n  match /b/{bucket}/o {\\n    match /financial-reports/{year}/{file} {\\n      allow read: if request.auth != null;\\n      allow write: if request.auth.token.role in ['boardMember','admin'];\\n    }\\n    match /uploads/{allPaths=**} {\\n      allow read: if request.auth != null;\\n      allow write: if isBoardMember();\\n    }\\n  }\\n}\\n```\\n4.6  Environment variables (.env.local.sample)\\n   NEXT_PUBLIC_FIREBASE_API_KEY=\\n   …(standard firebase)\\n   COOKIE_SECRET_SIGNING=\\n   FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY_JSON=\\n   SENDGRID_API_KEY=   # optional email\\n\\n5. CONTACT FORM IMPLEMENTATION \\napp/(public)/contact/page.tsx  – renders <ContactForm>\\nforms/ContactForm.tsx          – fields, honeypot, fetch POST /api/contact\\napi/contact/route.ts           – validate > addDoc(contact_messages) > optional send email > JSON {ok:true}\\nUI feedback with Alert component.\\n\\n6. ADMIN DASHBOARD – NO-CODE CMS FOR BOARD MEMBERS\\n• Built inside (admin)/layout.tsx sidebar links.\\n• News CRUD pages use R